OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night violence condemned
OL,4,Aas six arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people, including three teenage
OL,7,Fboys, have been arrested after a night
OL,8,Fof violence saw fireworks and bricks
OL,9,Flaunched at emergency services on
OL,10,FBonfire Night.
OL,12,FNorthumbria Police said its crews had
OL,13,Fbeen attacked after responding to
OL,14,Freports of anti-social behaviour in the
OL,15,FWaterville Road area of Meadow Well in
OL,16,FNorth Tyneside at about 21:00 GMT on
OL,17,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
