OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night violence condemned
OL,4,Aas six arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of officers were injured, the
OL,7,Fforce said, and five police cars and
OL,8,Fthree fire engines were damaged during
OL,9,Fthe disorder, which had been linked to
OL,10,Fmisinformation about a building's
OL,11,Ffuture as a House in Multiple
OL,12,FOccupation (HMO).
OL,14,FCh Supt Daniel Whyte said anyone else
OL,15,Finvolved in the disorder should expect
OL,16,Fa "knock on the door".
